From 03b440ab160045004dbbc79e641c55c731b400ad Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Josh Boyd <boydjd@jbip.net>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 07:46:57 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 08/13] hw/sd: add a Synopsys DesignWare MSHC (dw_mmc) model

One card slot on an SD bus, with data moved by the internal DMA
controller (4-word descriptors, ring or chain mode); the FIFO/PIO path
is not modelled.  Commands and transfers complete synchronously, with
auto-stop (CMD12) support and the usual raw/masked and IDMAC interrupt
status.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0158d423kzUx8WWBMMEZ95NX
---
